    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Senior / Creative Director-level, approx 20 years experience. Argentine-born, German-raised; graduated Gerrit Rietveld Academy 2005. Started as freelance designer at Fantastic Man (Amsterdam), then art director at The Gentlewoman 2009-2019, creative director 2019-2021 (12+ years, 24 issues). Now runs Studio Veronica Ditting full-time from the Barbican, London, with a small team of approx four. Client list is top-tier: Hermes, Miu Miu, The Row, Maison Margiela, Tiffany and Co, Somerset House, Design Museum, Het Nieuwe Instituut. Work spans editorial, identity/branding for fashion houses, campaigns, exhibition design, book design. Autonomy 5: sole principal of her own studio with no employer, direct client relationships at the highest level. Work Status Studio confirmed by site and multiple profiles. Instagram @studioveronicaditting confirmed from studio site and search results. LinkedIn snippet confirmed at uk.linkedin.com/in/veronica-ditting-b1807a10.",
